I reached home on my bicycle.
I quickly ate dinner.
Now I am sitting on the chair in the room.
I took my phone.
I made a video call to Mexico.
Mother answered the phone.
Mother looked at me and smiled happily.
"Hello Maya, are you well?" mother asked.
"I am fine, mother."
"Did you eat breakfast?"
I asked.
"Yes, I ate an hour ago," mother said.
Then I saw our dog on the screen.
Lola is sleeping on the sofa behind.
"Look, Lola is sleeping well," I said with a smile.
"Yes, she walked a lot this morning," mother said.
"So she is very tired."
"How was your day today?" mother asked.
"Today was a good day."
"I played badminton in the evening."
"I saw my friends there."
"We talked a lot."
"What all did you talk about?" mother asked.
"I told them the story of me coming to Kochi in January," I replied.
